"action=\"simul\">&Alt;&Shift; <keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> to start this "
"feature in a separate window, or open it inside the <link "
"linkend=\"sidebar\">Sidebar</link>."
msgstr ""
"चिनोतु<menuchoice><guimenu> उपकरणाः</guimenu><guimenuitem> डिस्कस्य "
"उपयोगः...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> वा<keycombo action=\"simul\"> "
"&amp;अल्ट;&amp;शिफ्ट;<keycap> स</keycap></keycombo> पृथक् विण्डो मध्ये एतत् "
"विशेषता आरभ्य, अथवा अन्तः उद्घाटयितुं<link linkend=\"sidebar\"> "
"पार्श्वपट्टिका</link> ."

